<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="container page-content">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">People who make service possible</p>
    <h1><%= title %></h1>
    <p>Volunteers contribute their time, skills, and care to help service organizations complete meaningful projects.</p>
  </section>
  

  <section class="card-grid">
    <article class="info-card">
      <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
      <h2>Volunteer opportunities</h2>
      <p>In the full course project, volunteers will be connected with service projects that match their interests and availability.</p>
    </article>

  
    <article class="info-card">
      <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
      <h2>Volunteer profiles</h2>
      <p>A later database stage can store volunteer information and connect each volunteer with relevant service activity.</p>
    </article>


    <article class="info-card">
      <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
      <h2>Get involved</h2>
      <p>Explore the project and organization pages to understand the kinds of community service represented in this initial site.</p>
      <a href="/projects">Explore projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </article>
  </section>

  <p class="notice">This initial page is a static starting point. Volunteer registration, stored profiles, and database relationships should be added when required by the relevant course assignment.</p>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
